{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53377","headline":"渔父词 · 顾况","name":"渔父词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新妇矶边月明，女儿浦口潮平，沙头鹭宿鱼惊。\n（见宋曾慥《乐府雅词》卷中徐俯词跋引、吴曾《能改斋漫录》卷十六《水光山色渔父家风》引徐师川云引）（按：《全唐诗》卷二六七据《野客丛书》卷二一所录，仅存前二句，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}